px\"> </span><span style=\"color:red;font-family:Consolas,&#39;courier new&#39;;font-size:15px;line-height:17.25px\">src=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,205);font-family:Consolas,&#39;courier new&#39;;font-size:15px;line-height:17.25px\">&quot;pic_mountain.jpg&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Consolas,&#39;courier new&#39;;font-size:15px;line-height:17.25px\"> </span><span style=\"color:red;font-family:Consolas,&#39;courier new&#39;;font-size:15px;line-height:17.25px\">alt=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,205);font-family:Consolas,&#39;courier new&#39;;font-size:15px;line-height:17.25px\">&quot;Mountain View&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Consolas,&#39;courier new&#39;;font-size:15px;line-height:17.25px\"> </span><span style=\"color:red;font-family:Consolas,&#39;courier new&#39;;font-size:15px;line-height:17.25px\">style=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,205);font-family:Consolas,&#39;courier new&#39;;font-size:15px;line-height:17.25px\">&quot;width:304px;height:228px;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:blue;font-family:Consolas,&#39;courier new&#39;;font-size:15px;line-height:17.25px\">&gt;</span>). Locally everything works well but as soon as I deploy my application on <a href=\"http://shinyapp.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapp.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792362950585000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3t9GK2TxeMN4iIfo09AP0i\">shinyapp.io</a>, the jpg images are not displayed anymore.<div><br></div><div>Do you know why shinyapp couldn&#39;t recognize my image path?<span><font color=\"#888888\"><br><div><br></div></font></span></div></div></span><span><font color=\"#888888\"><span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;ShinyApps Users&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a href data-em